   "note": "ESTIMATED BEYOND ITS SPAN. The maker's pages give the controller (a hot-swappable iX12 module) from its span, with a colour display, four buttons, two 10/100/1000 Ethernet jacks, two USB-A, one USB-B, a PDU link jack, a sensor jack, a reset pinhole and two lamps (View C, not dimensioned). The display and the buttons are the PXO's measured sizes (the same maker), and every place inside the span is an estimate (gaps: controller-layout)."
